{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "acbb0d4d-beb1-45ab-97d9-9a47e5dba0be",
    "name": "Banco Chillo — API (vía Gateway)",
    "description": "Colección del grupo. Todas las peticiones pasan por el API Gateway: {{baseUrl}} = <gateway>/api/v1 y {{gatewayUrl}} = <gateway> (salud). Ver docs/postman/README.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// =====================================================================",
          "// Obtiene un token JWT automáticamente antes de cada request.",
          "// - Lo guarda en la variable de colección \"token\" y lo reutiliza 50 minutos.",
          "// - Hoy usa el endpoint de desarrollo (solo funciona en local/Docker).",
          "// - Cuando exista el login real (Issue #17) cambiar \"modoToken\" a \"login\" en el entorno",
          "//   y completar usuarioPrueba / clavePrueba (datos ficticios, nunca reales).",
          "// =====================================================================",
          "const ahora = Date.now();",
          "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"token\");",
          "const expira = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"tokenExpira\") || 0);",
          "if (token && ahora < expira) { return; }",
          "",
          "const base = pm.environment.get(\"baseUrl\") || pm.collectionVariables.get(\"baseUrl\");",
          "const modo = pm.environment.get(\"modoToken\") || \"desarrollo\";",
          "const peticion = modo === \"login\"",
          "    ? {",
          "        url: base + \"/auth/login\",",
          "        method: \"POST\",",
          "        header: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },",
          "        body: { mode: \"raw\", raw: JSON.stringify({",
          "            usuario: pm.environment.get(\"usuarioPrueba\"),",
          "            clave: pm.environment.get(\"clavePrueba\"),",
          "        }) },",
          "    }",
          "    : {",
          "        url: base + \"/auth/token-desarrollo?rol=\" + (pm.environment.get(\"rol\") || \"ROLE_ADMIN\"),",
          "        method: \"POST\",",
          "    };",
          "",
          "pm.sendRequest(peticion, (error, respuesta) => {",
          "    if (error || respuesta.code !== 200) {",
          "        console.warn(\"No se pudo obtener token (\" + modo + \"):\", error || respuesta.code);",
          "        return;",
          "    }",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", respuesta.json().accessToken);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenExpira\", ahora + 50 * 60 * 1000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenExpira",
      "value": "0"
    },
